{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1235368720344008216,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Review Changes Requested",
      "source_hash": 2860552587704129469,
      "context_hash": 6303742347497719813,
      "translation": "리뷰 변경 요청",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059004Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature will automatically adjust the labels on a pull request when a reviewer[^1] sends a review with changes requested.",
      "source_hash": 1075528579999142882,
      "context_hash": 4709516865694370,
      "translation": "이 기능은 리뷰어[^1]가 변경을 요청하는 리뷰를 보낼 때 풀 리퀘스트의 레이블을 자동으로 조정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트",
        "reviewer": "리뷰어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:20.581355Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For the purpose of this feature, a reviewer can either be one of the assignees or anyone who has \"write\" permissions on the repository.",
      "source_hash": 13498838971229451827,
      "context_hash": 16244314792955914743,
      "translation": "이 기능의 목적상, 리뷰어는 담당자 중 한 명이거나 저장소에 대해 \"write\" 권한을 가진 사람이면 누구든 해당됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "reviewer": "리뷰어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:20.581356Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 12850076065413081862,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When creating a pull request review, click the \"Request Changes\" option when finishing the review.",
      "source_hash": 5133134497949322493,
      "context_hash": 5177805814247141631,
      "translation": "풀 리퀘스트 리뷰를 작성할 때, 리뷰를 마칠 때 \"Request Changes\" 옵션을 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This will automatically remove the review labels, and add a new label to indicate that the PR is waiting on the author.",
      "source_hash": 17082550832394114759,
      "context_hash": 7838511208437134429,
      "translation": "이는 리뷰 레이블을 자동으로 제거하고, PR이 작성자의 응답을 기다리고 있음을 나타내는 새 레이블을 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:20.581356Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 3526143439916647672,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059005Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[review-submitted]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 6301723133985102569,
      "context_hash": 5476116926316283150,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[review-submitted]` 테이블을 두면 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059006Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 3844988111542618159,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059006Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/review_submitted.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/review_submitted.rs).",
      "source_hash": 10690642091543946666,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/review_submitted.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/review_submitted.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:13.059006Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}